# text = My future relations with Mr . Armadale are still left undecided ; and the serious question raised by my father's letter is a question which we have neither of us faced yet It may possibly help your decision if I tell you how I determined to act toward Mr . Armadale -- in the matter of the similarity of our names -- when I first read this letter , and when I had composed myself sufficiently to be able to think at all Will you excuse the odd fancy of an odd man I want to put out the candle : I want to speak of the new subject , in the new light I must once more ask your patience if I return for a moment to myself and my circumstances .
