# text = He will drive to a public-house where he is known , will dismiss the cab at the door , and will go out again by a back way which is only used by the landlord and his friends .-- L . G I hear you have outnumbered the Strasbourg apostles , and outcrowed the Strasbourg cock and I am dying , absolutely dying , major , to see your wonderful clock Excuse me for interrupting you I happen to have seen the clock at Strasbourg ; and it sounds almost absurd in my ears ( if you will pardon me for saying so ) to put my little experiment in any light of comparison with that wonderful achievement .
