# text = In the first place , if you go to school , the necessary rules in such places -- necessary for the sake of the other girls -- would not permit you to see Mr . Armadale or to receive letters from him ; and , if you are to become mistress of Thorpe Ambrose , to school you must go , for you would be ashamed , and I should be ashamed , if you occupied the position of a lady of station without having the accomplishments which all ladies of station are expected to possess .
