# text = I acknowledged that I had left my husband behind me on the Continent ; but when the doctor put the question , I allowed him to conclude -- I couldn't , with all my resolution , tell him positively !-- that Midwinter knew of the contemplated Fraud , and that he was staying away purposely , so as not to compromise me by his presence .
